                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "65e76ebf-ec68-4d35-aefa-f55ee2966a44",
                        "entry_id": "01430fca-73eb-3518-bb24-a270bfba8f2f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "дворня́гах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dd4b3c42-2118-3f5a-9be9-6f4e8b203177",
                        "entry_id": "01430fca-73eb-3518-bb24-a270bfba8f2f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. непородистая — обычно дворовая — собака"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6257378c-6217-41f3-986a-8c103f74f334",
                                "sense_id": "dd4b3c42-2118-3f5a-9be9-6f4e8b203177",
                                "text": "За ним, высунув свой длинный, серый от пыли язык, бежит большая дворняга, худая, как собачий скелет, с всклокоченной шерстью. .. Мужичонок то и дело оборачивается к своему спутнику. // — Пшла! — говорит он пугливо. // Дворняга отскакивает назад, оглядывается и, постояв немного, продолжает шествовать за своим хозяином."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "31650a79-73a0-4956-b27e-61b6df94a89a",
                                "sense_id": "dd4b3c42-2118-3f5a-9be9-6f4e8b203177",
                                "text": "По наружности это — обыкновенная дворняга, с загнутым на спину хвостом, но опытный глаз сразу оценит породистую голову с большими глазами и острой мордой, сильную грудь и породистые, тонкие ноги."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "908158d3-e8ae-4857-9212-dbb322d63b41",
                                "sense_id": "dd4b3c42-2118-3f5a-9be9-6f4e8b203177",
                                "text": "Громадный дворняга Шарик,.., распластался над Хиной в виде трапеции, неестественно вытянув задние и передние ноги, но ничего поделать не мог и только насмешил кухню."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fcad94c-bbdb-4325-a517-2c76ccfc769c",
                                "sense_id": "dd4b3c42-2118-3f5a-9be9-6f4e8b203177",
                                "text": "Мунька .. — молодой дворняга, далеко неказистой наружности, проживал несколько лет тому назад в дровяном подвале большого дома за № 12, по Пятой Рождественской улице на Песках."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba79b731-cc4c-4532-b081-5402dff0cca1",
                                "sense_id": "dd4b3c42-2118-3f5a-9be9-6f4e8b203177",
                                "text": ".. у мёртвого переулка — какой-то долговязый с обрубленным хвостом дворняга облаял его «барской сволочью» и «шестёркой»."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "93980c39-4450-4a34-b274-e3f0ffa9b2fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "01430fca-73eb-3518-bb24-a270bfba8f2f",
                        "source_sense_id": "dd4b3c42-2118-3f5a-9be9-6f4e8b203177",
                        "target_lang_word": "cur",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cur",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f456aaab-9e66-3b15-be61-2abe9e6a36c6",
                                        "entry_id": "853e333d-f80a-321a-9f19-ee0bfe8ceabd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A contemptible or inferior dog."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "humorous"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1627a352-3ea8-40c0-861d-a327919022af",
                                                "sense_id": "f456aaab-9e66-3b15-be61-2abe9e6a36c6",
                                                "text": "A fals double tunge is more fiers and fell\nThen Cerberus the cur couching in the kenel of hel;\nWherof hereafter, I thinke for to write,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23a187af-6e9a-490f-a6a2-fe02a51104d2",
                                                "sense_id": "f456aaab-9e66-3b15-be61-2abe9e6a36c6",
                                                "text": "you have many enemies, that know not why they are so, but, like to village-curs, bark when their fellows do."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "871bec4f-daaa-4ac1-9984-31efbc7c915a",
                                                "sense_id": "f456aaab-9e66-3b15-be61-2abe9e6a36c6",
                                                "text": "A Churliſh Envious Curr vvas gotten into a Manger, and there lay Growling and Snarling to keep the Horſes from their Provender. The Dog Eat None himſelf, and yet rather Ventur'd the Starving his Own Carcaſe then he would ſuffer any thing elfe to be the Better for't."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b219a2cc-84a5-467a-be4e-8fd9fbb24c14",
                                                "sense_id": "f456aaab-9e66-3b15-be61-2abe9e6a36c6",
                                                "text": "He threw the soapsuds skilfully over a wretched little yellow cur he had, then turning his face to the agent's house, he shouted from the distance, \"All the men gone last night!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b54401a1-5bea-4853-810a-04865a800e92",
                                                "sense_id": "f456aaab-9e66-3b15-be61-2abe9e6a36c6",
                                                "text": "\"You have no more spirit than a mongrel cur. You lie down on the ground and ask people to trample on you.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4696ee56-7c28-3337-83e1-c6cb811dc9f2",
                                        "entry_id": "853e333d-f80a-321a-9f19-ee0bfe8ceabd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A detestable person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "humorous"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9210cac8-9ee4-499e-bc7b-1b9419abb2dc",
                                                "sense_id": "4696ee56-7c28-3337-83e1-c6cb811dc9f2",
                                                "text": "This butcher's cur is venom-mouth'd, and I have not the power to muzzle him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae1f8b5b-113f-4695-99f5-f084ed38a109",
                                                "sense_id": "4696ee56-7c28-3337-83e1-c6cb811dc9f2",
                                                "text": "\"Who 's a cur - now - hey?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ba05934-d98b-4f53-9fd4-00a5269ff6c4",
                                                "sense_id": "4696ee56-7c28-3337-83e1-c6cb811dc9f2",
                                                "text": "Clayton interrupted him. “Stop!” he cried. “Stop! What manner of cur are you that you traduce the character of a good woman whom we believe dead! God!”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e3814bd-db84-30f5-80b9-76548bae868e",
                                        "entry_id": "853e333d-f80a-321a-9f19-ee0bfe8ceabd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sheepdog or watchdog."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "dialectal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fff97f7-d2fe-4645-8743-8f4214e33bd9",
                                                "sense_id": "2e3814bd-db84-30f5-80b9-76548bae868e",
                                                "text": "Then send our Curs to gather up the Sheep"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "552f6622-fea0-4394-9ac3-a71fe82a9b57",
                                                "sense_id": "2e3814bd-db84-30f5-80b9-76548bae868e",
                                                "text": "\"He's a good sharp cur,\" or \"a good cur,\" is said of any dog that barks at strangers and guards his master's property."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b899c4aa-d99d-4ecf-9f11-b44c9cb72b32",
                        "source_entry_id": "01430fca-73eb-3518-bb24-a270bfba8f2f",
                        "source_sense_id": "dd4b3c42-2118-3f5a-9be9-6f4e8b203177",
                        "target_lang_word": "mongrel",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mongrel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2227291-d797-353c-8069-f33c337979dc",
                                        "entry_id": "34a06d29-6fc4-38f5-8925-4c22f8a17aba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something of mixed kind or uncertain origin, especially a dog."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "002cd8d9-539f-4391-88af-24763837cc71",
                                                "sense_id": "f2227291-d797-353c-8069-f33c337979dc",
                                                "text": "That dog is a mongrel; who knows what breed it could be!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c0e88b5-cd85-47c2-b1cc-043affb498ca",
                                                "sense_id": "f2227291-d797-353c-8069-f33c337979dc",
                                                "text": "America is an improbable idea. A mongrel nation built of ever-changing disparate parts, it is held together by a notion, the notion that all men are created equal, though everyone knows that most men consider themselves better than someone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "103d6bb6-1798-387a-81ba-ea37c54a70c8",
                                        "entry_id": "34a06d29-6fc4-38f5-8925-4c22f8a17aba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something of mixed kind or uncertain origin, especially a dog.",
                                            "A mixed-race person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "ethnic",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "often",
                                            "slur"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6e127f6-2822-317c-ba41-37560c184b39",
                                        "entry_id": "34a06d29-6fc4-38f5-8925-4c22f8a17aba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thuggish, obnoxious, or contemptible person; (often preceded by \\\"poor\\\") a pitiable person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Commonwealth",
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85d19b32-ef45-4dd2-adbe-e08ad9c7cb9b",
                                                "sense_id": "e6e127f6-2822-317c-ba41-37560c184b39",
                                                "text": "\"Yanto bloody Evans!\" Jack stuttered with rage. \"Yanto bloody Evans! That... that... bloody mongrel! D'you know who he is? He's the one who knocked me back for a bit of extra timber before the roof fell in on me!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14f45a9e-3296-445c-8fbd-2a9c156d2457",
                                                "sense_id": "e6e127f6-2822-317c-ba41-37560c184b39",
                                                "text": "But somebody's got to tell these mums and dads why their kids died, why this mongrel thinks he can wipe them out like a dirty rag."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b3eba05-617c-3185-947f-fc9b01c7e5c1",
                                        "entry_id": "34a06d29-6fc4-38f5-8925-4c22f8a17aba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An erect penis; an erection."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mongrel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b29c23cd-8c5c-3f4a-8d42-7b607d086da4",
                                        "entry_id": "206a76b2-484c-3555-9eb4-8c0ff2468b03",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of mixed breed, nature, or origin; of or like a mongrel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a047fc96-0b2e-4475-9868-7c929e440eae",
                                                "sense_id": "b29c23cd-8c5c-3f4a-8d42-7b607d086da4",
                                                "text": "English spelling is often regarded as confusing and unpredictable due to the mongrel nature of that language."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e25fc126-6fcd-4bbc-bb43-035aec4a934f",
                                                "sense_id": "b29c23cd-8c5c-3f4a-8d42-7b607d086da4",
                                                "text": "a mongrel dog"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1facba62-49a5-4fab-8c93-f64c455db467",
                        "source_entry_id": "01430fca-73eb-3518-bb24-a270bfba8f2f",
                        "source_sense_id": "dd4b3c42-2118-3f5a-9be9-6f4e8b203177",
                        "target_lang_word": "mutt",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mutt",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b01654cc-9272-3d24-b9f3-e231aa5374d6",
                                        "entry_id": "04dcd22e-b799-3255-bd82-69d8dafc7b24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mongrel dog (or sometimes cat); an animal of mixed breed or uncertain origin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "315f0671-7bfa-4251-bdc1-cfe8d1b378a3",
                                                "sense_id": "b01654cc-9272-3d24-b9f3-e231aa5374d6",
                                                "text": "Mr. Beerbelly, Beerbelly / Get these mutts away from me / You know, I don't find this stuff amusing anymore"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb08aefe-12ce-3464-85cf-0d22f3d4e2e7",
                                        "entry_id": "04dcd22e-b799-3255-bd82-69d8dafc7b24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person of mixed racial or ethnic ancestry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "humorous",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0d97929-a6c1-4280-bad9-6ce05d1eaa8b",
                                                "sense_id": "cb08aefe-12ce-3464-85cf-0d22f3d4e2e7",
                                                "text": "Soon, we will no longer be an outpost of Europe, but a nation of mutts, a nation with hundreds of fluid ethnicities from around the world, intermarrying and intermingling. Americans of European descent are already a minority among 5-year-olds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "387d4f9c-31e4-3b30-a541-04a675bced61",
                                        "entry_id": "04dcd22e-b799-3255-bd82-69d8dafc7b24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An idiot, a stupid person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf1f8e6a-0625-45ba-ab16-4ee96841d83f",
                                                "sense_id": "387d4f9c-31e4-3b30-a541-04a675bced61",
                                                "text": "Mother fuckin' mutt! You, you fucking piece of shit!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "559e44c3-9640-4780-b279-c59a3b074424",
                                                "sense_id": "387d4f9c-31e4-3b30-a541-04a675bced61",
                                                "text": "“He’s so blatantly stupid. He’s a punk. He’s a dog. He’s a pig. A con. A bullshit artist. A mutt who doesn’t know what he’s talking about,” he said, among many other things, in a video."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37cb5812-f17c-38b0-9eb8-7eac1e65ad4d",
                                        "entry_id": "04dcd22e-b799-3255-bd82-69d8dafc7b24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person from the United States, in reference to sense 2."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5fe7481-2495-3f2c-86fb-4c8075c4a4b3",
                                        "entry_id": "04dcd22e-b799-3255-bd82-69d8dafc7b24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The snowy sheathbill."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
